{"title":"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 23","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Bash)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Bash)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Mild_Bash)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Mild Bash)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_MOP_2024\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by MOP 2024</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Monic quadratic polynomial <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> have the property that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> has zeros at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b036e6dde821ea237c9f9f19b6c20adf30b4b639.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-23, -21, -17,$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"151\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/b/1/7b1c7423bc2cabc550417c27a3760b8a998318a7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b49f668f73e5181e04854534005c8c416115e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> has zeros at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/e/f/1effc5e6692d834003552ddc11e76d4e12e394ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-59,-57,-51$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"146\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/0/b40027074d4aafea1b59bf972ffb3ac867a866d4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />. What is the sum of the minimum values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/7/ed7c48c645162451b8b184a5edb54dd1b9348fec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -100 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -82 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -73 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -64 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"483\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/a/cfadc880207aa66a17a0df0ffdd621b33e0a7a59.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = (x - a)^2 - b, Q(x) = (x - c)^2 - d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"322\" height=\"19\" />. Notice that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> has roots <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/d/daddc78438b8f76915392b97a8c5476dea8fa22c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\pm \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"55\" height=\"18\" />, so that the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> are the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/a/daa2daf364a02d51620bcf08c46bf6ffd892b11b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = a + \\sqrt {b}, a - \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"22\" />. For each individual equation, the sum of the roots will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/6/9f6072f36e4577a20084d5e518bf7e2f2068ab3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2c$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> (symmetry or Vieta's). Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/4/cb46b9165607510d1bda306eb6712823563c265e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4c = - 23 - 21 - 17 - 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"194\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/7475f1416ba09ea138c0b514d31052a558b7928d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = - 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"63\" height=\"13\" />. Doing something similar for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b49f668f73e5181e04854534005c8c416115e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/243d9be138d829c8d64223816be7573e7c16f181.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = - 54$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"66\" height=\"13\" />.\nWe now have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/6/106e3e22b2719600a3dba8c91138d1aaa15bc935.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = (x + 54)^2 - b, Q(x) = (x + 19)^2 - d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"343\" height=\"21\" />. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" /> is monic, the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/0/1402b0056a23b2d51ace1c77925a182fb0af3cae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = a + \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"22\" /> are \"farther\" from the axis of symmetry than the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/c/4ccb1d29bf960b86982f919aa374fac93006c88b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = a - \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"22\" />. Thus, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715c3299730503275810f7235e3a90c90d752b1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q( - 23) = - 54 + \\sqrt {b}, Q( -21) =- 54 - \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"333\" height=\"22\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/d/50d91cbf7455cebdffddfd306219d007d5534a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - d = - 54 + \\sqrt {b}, 4 - d = - 54 - \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"302\" height=\"21\" />. Adding these gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/e/40ea101855b1c028ca63c2ce0955fc31c02f1355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 - 2d = - 108$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"123\" height=\"13\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/e/75e63123c570d078498dd734fc7996c8fe98b0c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 64$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"51\" height=\"13\" />. Plugging this into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/4/e245f1b52c09d571affb154a8915dd539948dc5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16 - d = - 54 + \\sqrt {b}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"152\" height=\"19\" />, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/e/13eae6c93267da55037d62be2372e475d032d750.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 36$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />.\nThe minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/5/e/05e7dff418736af20bf61bd56bf7a20fd7d0a674.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- b$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" />, and the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/4/164f45abd55983a8e87fcb0ee029f3a9a0d31ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- d$\" width=\"23\" height=\"12\" />. Thus, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/b/c2bc7e167c04604697f9f663be24512bbb3c6be8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$- (b + d) = - 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"18\" />, or answer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Bash.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Bash)\">Solution 2 (Bash)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Bash)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/3/f73804181cb185a7c3e3a583d6285b354004444f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = x^2 + Bx + C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d6167f9a2e6c2dab945afe65129c2e5bb4f63272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = x^2 + Ex + F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"164\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/9/839690c23919692f2434167436f15535220d33b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x^2 + Ex + F)^2 + B(x^2 + Ex + F) + C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"311\" height=\"19\" />, which simplifies to:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/a/9ea0bb17aab543290599d80fa26ea35d70ecd359.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x)) = x^4 + 2Ex^3 + (E^2 + 2F + B)x^2 + (2EF + BE)x + (F^2 + BF + C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"611\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>We can find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b49f668f73e5181e04854534005c8c416115e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> by simply doing <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/6/3569450bf287fd324da26144d746ebfb806e1615.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B\\Leftrightarrow E$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"57\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/c/4dcf53a7db0054cacfff0a05cbbd8ae90eeb477c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C \\Leftrightarrow F$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" /> to get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/b/8/fb8cb0da6b039210562dfd49d16078f908619bbf.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x)) = x^4 + 2Bx^3 + (B^2 + 2C + E)x^2 + (2BC + BE)x + (C^2 + EC + F)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"612\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>The sum of the zeros of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/2/9/b296e5a7df4c32ba9cfda8065802e1fea03efd64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-76$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />. From Vieta, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/1/c/c1c298d6936e2775e670c41037b4c14bf0c412a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2E$\" width=\"37\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/0/240dec03bb52521a98a7a2f45a812bb10465e53d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E = 38$\" width=\"56\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of the zeros of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b49f668f73e5181e04854534005c8c416115e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/c/24c5154222a0f58789633cb039c47476c7c70134.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-216$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"40\" height=\"13\" />. From Vieta, the sum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d610a8dff7008e3443ce4b4ddb0a01528e24436f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-2B$\" width=\"37\" height=\"12\" />. Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/3/2c359908f7e3672f6614080bea0f44d81e3d7b21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B = 108$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"65\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>Plugging in, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/2/8b21e721800774e9d11ff7f43b415e1224353251.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x)) = x^4 + 76x^3 + (1552 + 2F)x^2 + (76F + 4104)x + (F^2 + 108F + C)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"598\" height=\"19\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/1/5c179f5a2a7507cf97837a986319cab37cf76fa7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x)) = x^4 + 216x^3 + (11702 + 2C)x^2 + (216C + 4104)x + (C^2 + 38C + F)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"616\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p>Let's tackle the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/b/76b2878564ab19b80abb21ba964abe90fe120846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> coefficients, which is the sum of the six double-products possible. Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/1/4116ac692ab7aa429705dc27867abee577757b77.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$23 \\cdot (21 + 17 + 15) + 21 \\cdot (17 + 15) + 17 \\cdot 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"341\" height=\"18\" /> gives the sum of these six double products of the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/3/b43bf9c5b2cb82cc968055c9582551e4f449ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1552 + 2F = 23 \\cdot (21 + 17 + 15) + 21 \\cdot (17 + 15) + 17 \\cdot 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"448\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/a/65a74d9735aac5f49362c83f845f45de3a1300af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1552 + 2F = 2146$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"141\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/6/7/86796f1ae9f6d8f6cf070a7ee946ef3a9e5d3cf8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F = 297$\" width=\"65\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Similarly with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b49f668f73e5181e04854534005c8c416115e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />, we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/3/a/03abca43ca7ee9a9fbd736afab9414cd5877bc09.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11702 + 2C = 59(57 + 51 + 49) + 57(51 + 49) + 51(49)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"430\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5032bd6e45811433d7be2953feca41681412dd5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11702 + 2C = 17462$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"160\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/5/3e5b1e6eaddac68ea92ad0809aa86c5af7749bfa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C = 2880$\" width=\"74\" height=\"12\" />\n</p><p>Thus, our polynomials are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/7/3a70129fd7006fa06b0a8ac71d3f3ed18119ea66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = x^2 + 108x + 2880$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f358e9ebb2079ed37a6354f5a3e51b2931127d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = x^2 + 38x + 297$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>The minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> happens at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fff9212b63aaeeb0c5bb09d62d0988e7b010a559.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{108}{2} = -54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"38\" />, and is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/3/533dfb2b6bef97510df369f588932463c9079d6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$54^2 - 108 \\cdot 54 + 2880 = 2880 - 54^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"272\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> happens at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/b/a4b4c61f1cfe5e7a23585adb3749a6a5efdc6488.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = -\\frac{38}{2} = -19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"129\" height=\"38\" />, and is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/4/c/f4c74f09fc592139451df6f61f1e24004ab36b88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$19^2 - 38 \\cdot 19 + 297 = 297 - 19^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"244\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The sum of these minimums is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/0/670e9e820738e1acbb2e4f10a2a509484a0cbedc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2880 +297 - 54^2 - 19^2 = \\boxed{-100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -7px\" width=\"259\" height=\"24\" />. -srisainandan6\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Mild_Bash.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Mild_Bash)\">Solution 3 (Mild Bash)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Mild Bash)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/4/064fa67e0fe8b760f87dc72b18a4683862cc389e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = x^2 - (a+b)x + ab$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"207\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7c5aed604a7978f77bb595c4d3d9b2d2ebc929.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = x^2 - (c+d)x + cd$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"207\" height=\"19\" />. Notice that the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/b/e9bdf3e496517e8f8742f81dd774be1f93cf6e8c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"18\" /> and the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f75fd2f8836bf1a415012028365986ef8c7a212.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c,d.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"29\" height=\"16\" /> Then we get:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/f/d7fa3191f11488c5688db3016167abf5c872d4a5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} P(Q(x)) &amp;= a, b \\\\ x^2 - (c+d)x + cd &amp;= a, b \\end{align*}\" width=\"193\" height=\"45\" />\nThe two possible equations are then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/a/3eade556543b257e73cd2706e00e9c0c399fc913.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - (c+d)x + cd-a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"208\" height=\"19\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/e/99e472aab6ad953c0cf023e57609db090a2e1485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^2 - (c+d)x + cd-b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"206\" height=\"19\" />. The solutions are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/0/d5087ded0279e3a470a2850e4d5379a78742c858.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-23, -21, -17, -15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"152\" height=\"16\" />. From Vieta's we know that the total sum <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e00c23eefeddff7b258c3fccfc539d33dad208d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2(c+d) = -76 \\implies c+d = -38$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"264\" height=\"18\" /> so the roots are paired <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/3/243a72a913aa0acf7a1875b18c624deab6adea6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-23, -15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/3/e3381913f64f103780dbc625f35cef3059894804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-21, -17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e5e38ed34a890ee416fae041b2713dee50b5275.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd - a = 23*15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"126\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/8/9/08958dcc4c9b6e3241b054fbfe24aae5bd117472.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd - b = 21*17$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"125\" height=\"13\" />.\n</p><p>We can similarly get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/8/7/187ff113a345b5c8103920c8f92d4bda0f38f77f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - c = 59*49$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"124\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/7/0c71c3c26190af1ee43e78e318993333b2fb5c3d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab - d = 57*51$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"125\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/2/c827feae9eebde58306e5d065dad5d5817f44da7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b = -108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"104\" height=\"14\" />. Add the first two equations to get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/0/ec0e9db7cf15afeb2a91dea744a8d48ad6afbd86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2cd - (a+b) = 23*15 + 21*17 \\implies cd = \\frac{23*15+21*17 - 108}{2} = 297.\\]\" width=\"543\" height=\"37\" /> This means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74f358e9ebb2079ed37a6354f5a3e51b2931127d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = x^2 + 38x + 297$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"181\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Once more, we can similarly obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/0/9908a678477aa6b4f139ecda1bd696c0d60f355a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[ab = \\frac{59*49 + 57*51 - 38}{2} = 2880.\\]\" width=\"278\" height=\"37\" /> Therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/7/3a70129fd7006fa06b0a8ac71d3f3ed18119ea66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = x^2 + 108x + 2880$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"19\" />.\n</p><p>Now we can find the minimums to be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/3/713d0021ca51a20554f3eb78cda712b17a9abdff.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[19^2 - 19*38 + 297 = -64\\]\" width=\"206\" height=\"16\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/a/41a6b3f3a9731b24bc0b5b3c85a5cc5a484817d5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[54^2 - 54*108 + 2880 = -36.\\]\" width=\"228\" height=\"16\" /> Summing, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/6/4a6643cecbc3adab8cf438a778d4e7668fccc027.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)} -100}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"93\" height=\"28\" />\n</p><p>~Leonard_my_dude~\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/8/e28d05c6bb5b64d6a607f95c730b2d8ba14d739f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = (x+a)(x+b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"172\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/7/6b7261671d8c040c0182a16e62f374bd293d1814.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = (x+c)(x+d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"176\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/b/dfbead5e2ea7461cfc1b5d81d8b124e4504e95d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x)) = (x^2 + cx + dx + cd + a)(x^2 + cx + dx + cd + b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"463\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/19298097b479cef8178ac67810d41cfab65b3831.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x)) = (x^2 + ax + bx + ab + c)(x^2 + ax + bx + ab + d)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"464\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p>Notice how the coefficient for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> has to be the same for the two quadratics that are multiplied to create <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/b/19b49f668f73e5181e04854534005c8c416115e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"65\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/d/51d9285925983ae1e4920db631da9bc67d040c9e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x)) = (x+ 23)(x+ 21)(x+ 17)(x+ 15) = (x^2 + 38x + 345)(x^2 + 38x + 357)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"642\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/b/bcbcca230322bb69fe1a0fbe0f98a52af8af36a4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(P(x)) = (x+ 59)(x+ 57)(x+ 51)(x+ 49) = (x^2 + 108x + 2891)(x^2 + 108x + 2907)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"678\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/e/a5ebea23cdebf1e319025571cd5e111078ab07fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c + d = 38$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/e/39ebae9d38c2fa578b31f4ee63c513306d992604.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd + a = 345$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"103\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/f/8cfa522e8d626e4ba0a35f47946077ab6a0c0ca9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd + b = 357$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"101\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/0/580f06672e631ebe15e9cd0c5810f8c052ce9397.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/d/79d281a5d94eb31d357f3202f8bc2c8f0b10ea82.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + c = 2891$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"110\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/3/e7316cbf85d781da867eea584789a9f2e1202b4d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$ab + d = 2907$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"112\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/a/bba2d9239a46b6d382aeda8a91bc87837ea22dc3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$cd = \\frac{345 + 357 - 108}{2} = 297$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"225\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/a/f7a32bc66f0901cfb900b3e35f91f97ea9b28822.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$297 = 3^3 \\cdot 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"101\" height=\"17\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/4/9e4979fa0e5cc9a3d80981a8468f727a6f4bb661.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 27$\" width=\"50\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/a/cca1e09711b2d3dfc92eabbf9561644fc87527f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"50\" height=\"13\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/6/cd69866e253a7609a8f42cb60c3b297ee59dee62.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 345 - 27*11 = 48$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"181\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/d/6/6d6c5a5e710e9aee2954d43d901e6437eb07e789.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 357 - 27*11 = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"179\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/f/47f94db5c10d87f12392fa1d233f709d97b8b6e0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x) = (x+48)(x+60) = x^2 + 108x + 2880 = (x+54)^2 - 36$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"492\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/0/b/d0b6f7e939b6d2efc3124f59c1329ff902992218.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x) = (x+27)(x+11) = x^2 + 38x + 297 = (x+19)^2 -64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"474\" height=\"21\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/e/28e28b4efe55759fb3a43d1fe69381c3e394938a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-36 -64 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(A) } -100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"195\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p><br />\n~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is a quadratic, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> only has two roots; however, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> has four roots, meaning that two of the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> must repeat themselves. \n</p><p><br />\nNotice that the four roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/9/a391549fa05320091d96f9251e4ac2e31376eb43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(Q(x))$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"69\" height=\"20\" /> are symmetric around <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/c/46c14983bef3fb285beec1f08dac4e11b53dc98d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=-19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />'s graph has vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/1/8c1aa7db025fb1513f98fb323abbf541a811ab5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-19$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" />; therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/d/a8db659c028329630ae107554af32a273ba4e2fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(-17)=Q(-21$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />) and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/7/d67e3d89c8179aee9c15c3c9f54be9eb6279da86.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(-15)=Q(-23)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"148\" height=\"20\" />. Similarly, we can deduce that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> has vertex <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07afd0dc2126e23ba987de95ac7f756beede363f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-54$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/f/5/5f5de64c0e37c9e7aa092dc49cb6ceac155da5b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(-51)=P(-57)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/5/9/c59fec2ad6bc92b5372bfab5560c092293a922d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(-49)=P(-59)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"147\" height=\"20\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nIf we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/3/b0366616ff3c916f8d2d62c7e9506f48d380325a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)=x^2+bx+c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"153\" height=\"21\" />, then since the vertex is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/b/45b3cdcbd2303c554fc4ec72bd8c75bfeeb15875.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-54,\\text{ }b=108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"107\" height=\"18\" />; similarly, we get that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/d/79d89518feb92b6e604e831f52976cf5cccdd661.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)=x^2+nx+m=x^2+38x+m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"296\" height=\"21\" />. Since the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/b/f7ba563b09447e292314d31c8d92a5859d60b058.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(-17)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/2/fd2482500c5ebb13743a55ff24a346e9870e1d3c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(-15)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" /> (or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/8/a586af5d8193f46a728d9603530b7130a8dbd895.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(-23)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/a/7ca3b91bc511e0cb3f832f038a0c20601dd3f460.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(-21)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"63\" height=\"20\" />, they are all equal), by simplifying we get that the roots of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/d/bdd0e294d637a9eb804b606f1be71ea9dd78fc05.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-357$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/4/fd471d478f6117d9ec5efc8c831d8f26887be608.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m-345$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"67\" height=\"15\" />. \n</p><p><br />\nBy Vieta's Formulas, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/6/4e66d59c90f53436e0ba931c5690a684714306f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(m-357)+(m-345)=-108$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"249\" height=\"20\" />, therefore <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/7/d8731c4ea951990b49788d2076944ed2c630958a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m=297$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"69\" height=\"14\" />. Similarly, we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/f/8afc78cf01ca9d1c75baa3338add3ddf4e7e7c47.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=2880$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"70\" height=\"14\" />. By applying the formula for minima, we get that the minimum for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/d/d9dfe7c7a0b887097fa2227a230fc915ba2e5477.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/8/b484bfb331b56f6c1fae1341daa9e5e94d9bdd13.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-64$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"34\" height=\"15\" /> and the minimum for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/5/7e526330242193d691d079b577029f828109e270.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-36$\" width=\"31\" height=\"12\" />, and therefore the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/c/81c733bd287d41acfb2666fefa4c52e283f05656.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{-100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -8px\" width=\"55\" height=\"26\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cf65b1f2fbdf388e3daeff9b96b34d3399d777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\square$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n~A7456321\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_MOP_2024\">Video Solution by MOP 2024</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by MOP 2024\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/FPhaUQoRtPs\">https://youtu.be/FPhaUQoRtPs</a>\n</p><p>~r00tsOfUnity\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_23&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B\">2010 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">Problem 24</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2010_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2010 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_12_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 12 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 12 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017063627\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.072 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 899/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2298/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 158/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 29447/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.287      1 -total\n 57.60%    8.230      1 Template:AMC12_box\n 40.88%    5.841      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8835:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017063627 and revision id 259477. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}